face-image: img/weimar_constitution.jpg
on-arrival: pro_republic += 3; staal_papen_r -= 1

= Goodryke's Resignation

With no progress made on securing <span style="color: #7A3C00;">Royalist</span> toleration of the cabinet, and Goodryke still unable to survive a Assembly vote when the chamber reconvenes, Staal has advised the chancellor to resign in order to calm the national mood. This would allow the President to seek a broader base of support without Goodryke at the helm.

However, Goodryke’s cabinet continues to function in a caretaker role, and little has changed fundamentally. As Goodryke has stated to his cabinet, none of this matters, as DuFour remains "firmly resolved to take all measures that might become necessary" to support him.